DI0OGQyNDAxODZiZWNiNWMxMTNkNmYyYmQ1ZjkzMGI4YmYzMWNkNTM","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/248d240186becb5c113d6f2bd5f930b8bf31cd53","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/248d240186becb5c113d6f2bd5f930b8bf31cd53","author":{"name":"Kristoffer Dalby","email":"kristoffer@dalby.cc","date":"2026-02-20T10:58:49Z"},"committer":{"name":"Kristoffer Dalby","email":"kristoffer@dalby.cc","date":"2026-02-20T10:58:49Z"},"tree":{"sha":"bf5a9ee51386db46256395e90ac94ae2f0e0905a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/trees/bf5a9ee51386db46256395e90ac94ae2f0e0905a"},"message":"node: implement disable key expiry via CLI and API\n\nAdd --disable flag to \"headscale nodes expire\" CLI command and\ndisable_expiry field handling in the gRPC API to allow disabling\nkey expiry for nodes. When disabled, the node's expiry is set to\nNULL and IsExpired() returns false.\n\nThe CLI follows the new grpcRunE/RunE/printOutput patterns\nintroduced in the recent CLI refactor.\n\nAlso fix NodeSetExpiry to persist directly to the database instead\nof going through persistNodeToDB which omits the expiry field.\n\nFixes #2681\n\nCo-authored-by: Marco Santos <me@marcopsantos.com>","parents":[{"sha":"7513b81c1695b2076a2d04e6c756df259b06ff47","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/7513b81c1695b2076a2d04e6c756df259b06ff47","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/7513b81c1695b2076a2d04e6c756df259b06ff47"}],"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null},"event":"committed"},{"id":22946030197,"node_id":"HRFPE_lADOEFLz887sVeqRzwAAAAVXsKJ1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/events/22946030197","actor":{"login":"kradalby","id":98431,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk4NDMx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/98431?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby","html_url":"https://github.co